["Misaal 2","مُجَاهِدُونَ","jihaad karne waale","هُمْ مُجَاهِدُونَ","woh log mujaahid hain"],["Misaal 3","شَاكِرُونَ","shukr-guzaar log","هُمْ شَاكِرُونَ","woh log shukr-guzaar hain"]]}},{"type":"rule_paragraph","text":"<div class=\"lesson-concept-svg\" style=\"margin:14px 0 18px 0;text-align:center;\">\n<svg viewBox=\"0 0 800 236\" width=\"100%\" style=\"max-width:800px;height:auto;border-radius:16px;box-shadow:0 4px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n  <defs>\n    <linearGradient id=\"hdrGrad\" x1=\"0%\" y1=\"0%\" x2=\"100%\" y2=\"0%\">\n      <stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#0f766e\"/>\n      <stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#047857\"/>\n    </linearGradient>\n  </defs>\n  <rect width=\"800\" height=\"58\" rx=\"16\" fill=\"url(#hdrGrad)\"/>\n  <rect y=\"42\" width=\"800\" height=\"16\" fill=\"url(#hdrGrad)\"/>\n  <text x=\"400\" y=\"26\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#ffffff\">Unit 5 • Sabaq 5 (Page 54): Zameer Jama Ghaib (هُمْ — Woh Log)</text>\n  <text x=\"400\" y=\"46\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#ccfbf1\">مُسْلِمُونَ (musalman) ← هُمْ مُسْلِمُونَ (woh log musalman hain)</text>\n  <rect x=\"18\" y=\"14\" width=\"110\" height=\"28\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"rgba(255,255,255,0.18)\"/>\n  <text x=\"73\" y=\"32\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#ffffff\">S5L5 • Pages 54–55</text>\n  \n        <g transform=\"translate(20, 74)\">\n          <rect width=\"240\" height=\"118\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"#ecfdf5\" stroke=\"#059669\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n          <text x=\"120\" y=\"30\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"'Amiri','Scheherazade New',serif\" font-size=\"20\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1e293b\" direction=\"rtl\">مُسْلِمُونَ</text>\n          <text x=\"120\" y=\"52\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#059669\">↓</text>\n          <text x=\"120\" y=\"76\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"'Amiri','Scheherazade New',serif\" font-size=\"22\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#059669\" direction=\"rtl\">هُمْ مُسْلِمُونَ</text>\n          <text x=\"120\" y=\"96\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#0f172a\">musalman → woh log musalman hain</text>\n          <text x=\"120\" y=\"111\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#475569\">Hum + Jama = Mukammal Jumla</text>\n        </g>\n        <g transform=\"translate(280, 74)\">\n          <rect width=\"240\" height=\"118\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"#f0f9ff\" stroke=\"#0284c7\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n          <text x=\"120\" y=\"30\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"'Amiri','Scheherazade New',serif\" font-size=\"20\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1e293b\" direction=\"rtl\">مُجَاهِدُونَ</text>\n          <text x=\"120\" y=\"52\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#0284c7\">↓</text>\n          <text x=\"120\" y=\"76\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"'Amiri','Scheherazade New',serif\" font-size=\"22\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#0284c7\" direction=\"rtl\">هُمْ مُجَاهِدُونَ</text>\n          <text x=\"120\" y=\"96\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#0f172a\">mujaahid → woh log mujaahid hain</text>\n          <text x=\"120\" y=\"111\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#475569\">3+ mardon ke liye (هُمْ)</text>\n        </g>\n        <g transform=\"translate(540, 74)\">\n          <rect width=\"240\" height=\"118\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"#f5f3ff\" stroke=\"#7c3aed\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n          <text x=\"120\" y=\"30\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"'Amiri','Scheherazade New',serif\" font-size=\"20\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1e293b\" direction=\"rtl\">الْمُتَّقُونَ</text>\n          <text x=\"120\" y=\"52\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#7c3aed\">↓</text>\n          <text x=\"120\" y=\"76\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"'Amiri','Scheherazade New',serif\" font-size=\"22\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#7c3aed\" direction=\"rtl\">هُمُ الْمُتَّقُونَ</text>\n          <text x=\"120\" y=\"96\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#0f172a\">parhezgaar → wahi log parhezgaar hain</text>\n          <text x=\"120\" y=\"111\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#475569\">Hum + Al- = Hasr (wahi log hi)</text>\n        </g>\n  <rect x=\"30\" y=\"202\" width=\"740\" height=\"24\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#f8fafc\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n  <text x=\"400\" y=\"218\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"11.5\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#334155\">Qaa'ida: (هُوَ) ek shakhs ke liye aur (هُمْ: woh log) teen ya zaa'id logon ke baare mein baat karne ke liye aata hai.</text>\n</svg>\n</div>In misaalon se waazeh hai ke (هُمْ) ka matlab (woh log) hai aur yeh bahut se mardon ka zikr karne ke liye istemaal hota hai. (هُوَ) ek shakhs ke baare mein aur (هُمْ) zyaada logon (teen ya zaa'id) ke baare mein baat karne ke liye aata hai. (هُمْ) aur uske baad jama ka lafz mil kar umooman ek mukammal jumla banaate hain:","data":{"text":"<div class=\"lesson-concept-svg\" style=\"margin:14px 0 18px 0;text-align:center;\">\n<svg viewBox=\"0 0 800 236\" width=\"100%\" style=\"max-width:800px;height:auto;border-radius:16px;box-shadow:0 4px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n  <defs>\n    <linearGradient id=\"hdrGrad\" x1=\"0%\" y1=\"0%\" x2=\"100%\" y2=\"0%\">\n      <stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#0f766e\"/>\n      <stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#047857\"/>